    product('r01-yin','plant','diaotang-yin','彫棠（隂山水文）','Diaotang (Yin water account)','其中多彫棠其葉如榆葉而方其實如赤菽食之已聾','Diaotang has square elm-like leaves and fruit like red beans, with an ancient eating claim.','水文后列彫棠，不据其中强定生境或现代树种。赤菽为豆状果比拟，非全株赤色。',commentary='菽豆',en_commentary='Guo Pu identifies shu as beans.')
