    add('r01-summary','rite','sangfeng-range1','桑封（首列神主）','Sangfeng ritual tablet','桑封者桑主也方其下而鋭其上而中穿之加金','Sangfeng is a mulberry tablet, square below and pointed above, pierced centrally and decorated with metal.','桑封神主与祭牲分开；公羊传及或作玉为郭注异说，不增神形。',commentary='言作神主而祭以金銀飾之也公羊傳曰虞主用桑主或作玉',en_commentary='Guo Pu describes a ritual tablet decorated with gold and silver, cites the Gongyang tradition and records a jade variant.')
