    form('r02-huizhu','he-huizhu','鶡（煇諸）','He birds (Huizhu)','其鳥多鶡','He birds are abundant.','鶡雉状而大、青色有毛来自郭注；双鸟足、尾羽、冠与配色细节为艺术解释，不定现代种。','Pheasant-like size and blue-green feathers follow commentary; ordinary bird details and pose are artistic.',commentary='似雉而大青色有毛勇徤闘死乃止音曷出上黨也',en_commentary='Guo Pu describes a large blue-green pheasant-like bird, records an ancient behavioral claim and supplies pronunciation and provenance.')
