    hua=form('r02-yang','huashe-yang','化蛇（陽水）','Huashe (Yang water)','其中多化蛇其狀如人靣而豺身鳥翼而蛇行其音如叱呼見則其邑大水','Huashe has a human face, jackal body and bird wings and moves like a snake; its call and flood omen are ancient.','人面豺身鸟翼、蛇行据文；四犬足、双翼、毛色及低行姿为解释，不画蛇尾蛇躯。','Snake-like movement is not a serpent tail; four ordinary canine limbs, wing pair, colors and pose are artistic.',water=True);pair(yang,hua)
