    form('r02-manqu','mafu-manqu','馬腹（蔓渠）','Mafu (Manqu)','有獸焉其名曰馬腹其狀如人靣虎身其音如嬰兒是食人','Mafu has a human face and tiger body, sounds like an infant and is described as eating people.','人面虎身据文，四虎足、尾形虎纹配色与成年面容为解释；婴儿是比音，不画暴力食人。','Four tiger paws, stripe colors, tail and adult facial styling are artistic; infant sound does not require infant anatomy.')
