    product('r03-aoan','material','fine-jade-aoan','羙玉（熏池居处）','Fine jade (Xunchi dwelling account)','是常出羙玉','Fine jade is regularly produced.','羙玉或作石的郭注跨71—72，不归河林形貌。',commentary='或作；石',en_commentary='The alternative stone reading spans units 71–72.')
    add('r03-aoan','place','helin-aoan','河林（敖岸北望）','Helin (Ao-an northward reference)','北望河林其狀如蒨如舉','It looks north toward Helin, compared to qian and ju.','北望名与蒨举比较依原词存录，郭注木名未详，不画水神或强定现代森林。',commentary='説者云蒨舉皆木名也未詳蒨音倩',en_commentary='Guo Pu reports that qian and ju are said to be tree names, leaves them uncertain and gives pronunciation.')
    form('r03-aoan','fuzhu-aoan','夫諸（敖岸）','Fuzhu (Ao-an)','有獸焉其狀如白鹿而四角名曰夫諸見則其邑大水','Fuzhu resembles a white deer with four horns and has an ancient flood omen.','白鹿四角逐数，四独立角根与四角尖分辨；简角形、四蹄、站姿为解释，非两角分四叉。','Four independent horns are mandatory; simple unbranched styling, ordinary deer limbs and pose are artistic.')
    add('r03-qingyao','place','secret-capital-qingyao','帝之密都（青要）','Emperor’s secluded capital (Qingyao)','實維帝之密都','This is the emperor’s secluded capital.','仅据郭注天帝曲密之邑，不新增帝像或现代城址。',commentary='天帝曲密之邑',en_commentary='Guo Pu calls it the heavenly emperor’s secluded settlement.')
    bend=water('r03-qingyao','he-bend-qingyao','河曲（青要北望）','He bend (Qingyao northward reference)','北望河曲','It looks north toward a bend of the He.','河曲千里一曲一直为古注，不变成现代测绘。',commentary='河千里一曲一直也',en_commentary='Guo Pu gives an ancient description of the river’s bends.');pair(bend,'water-zhongshan-he')
    add('r03-qingyao','place','shanzhu-qingyao','墠渚（青要南望）','Shanzhu (Qingyao southward reference)','南望墠渚禹父之所化','It looks south toward Shanzhu, where Yu’s father transformed.','郭注水中小洲名渚，地点与禹父变化各录，不推现代洲址。',commentary='水中小洲名渚墠音填也',en_commentary='Guo Pu identifies zhu as an islet and gives a pronunciation gloss.')
    unknown('r03-qingyao','deity','yufu-qingyao','禹父（墠渚变化述）','Yu’s father (Shanzhu transformation account)','禹父之所化','This is where Yu’s father transformed.','正文未载本处变化后的形貌；郭注羽渊黄熊与变怪性是另层辨说，不将黄熊直接填为此处神形。',commentary='鯀化於羽淵為黄熊今復云在此然則一已有；變怪之性者亦無徃而不化也',en_commentary='Guo Pu compares Gun’s Yellow Bear transformation at Yuyuan with this account and discusses transformations; it is not an independent anatomy statement for Shanzhu.')
