    wuluo=form('r03-qingyao','wuluo-qingyao','武羅（青要）','Wuluo (Qingyao)','武羅司之其狀人面而豹文小腰而白齒而穿耳以鐻其鳴如鳴玉','Wuluo has a human face, leopard markings, a slim waist, white teeth and pierced ears with ju ornaments and sounds like ringing jade.','人面豹文小腰白齿穿耳鐻据文，人形躯手足、服饰、环状鐻与性别面貌为解释；或作首异说不再叠加。','Human torso and limbs, sex styling, clothing and simple loop ornaments are artistic; no leopard head, tiger tail or halo is added.',kind='deity',commentary='武羅神名䰠即神字；或作首；鐻金銀噐之名未詳也音渠；如人鳴玉；佩聲',en_commentary='Guo Pu identifies the deity name, records a head variant, leaves the ju object uncertain and compares the sound to jade pendants; the sound gloss continues into unit 80.')
