    product('r03-qingyao','plant','xun-qingyao','荀草（青要）','Xun grass (Qingyao)','有草焉其狀如葌而方莖黄華赤實其本如藁本名曰荀草服之羙人色','Xun grass resembles jian, with square stems, yellow flowers, red fruit and a gaoben-like base, with an ancient complexion claim.','叶、茎、花、实、本的比较逐项存录，苞草为异名，不作现代药效认定。',commentary='菅似茅也；根似藁本亦香草；或作苞草；令人更羙豔',en_commentary='Guo Pu explains the comparisons, records Baocao as a variant name and glosses the ancient complexion claim.')
