    yong=water('r03-yisu','yongyong-yisu','滽滽之水（冝蘇）','Yongyong water (Yisu)','滽滽之水出焉而北流注于河','Yongyong water rises here and flows north into the He.',commentary='音容',en_commentary='Guo Pu gives yong pronunciation.');pair(yong,'water-zhongshan-he')
