    nine=water('r03-he','nine-waters-he','九水（和山）','Nine waters (He)','是山也五曲九水出焉合而北流注于河','The mountain has five turns and nine waters that unite and flow north into the He.','五曲九水依古述不造九条未名河卡，不定现代水系。',commentary='九水所潜故曰九都；曲回五重',en_commentary='Guo Pu explains the nine hidden waters and five turns.');pair(nine,'water-zhongshan-he')
    SHARES.append(('water-zhongshan-he','r03-he','九水出焉合而北流注于河','The nine waters unite and flow north into the He.'))
    product('r03-he','material','cang-jade-he','蒼玉（和山水文）','Cang jade (He water account)','其中多蒼玉','Cang jade is abundant in this water account.')
    taifeng=form('r03-he','taifeng-he','泰逢（和山）','Taifeng (He)','吉神泰逢司之其狀如人而虎尾是好居于萯山之陽出入有光太逢神動天地氣也','Taifeng is human-shaped with a tiger tail, favors the sunny side of Fu mountain, shines and moves the airs of heaven and earth.','人状虎尾据正文，双人手足、服色面貌与行姿为解释；或作雀尾仅异说不叠画，太逢/泰逢异写保留。','Human age, clothing and pose are artistic; the commentary bird-tail alternative is not added to the tiger tail.',kind='deity',commentary='吉猶善也；或作雀尾；言其有靈爽興雲雨也夏后孔甲田於萯山之下天大風晦冥孔甲迷；惑入于民室見吕氏春秋也',en_commentary='Guo Pu glosses ji as good, records a bird-tail alternative and describes divine airs; the Kongjia narrative continues across 94–95.')
    fu=add('r03-he','place','fu-sunny-taifeng','萯山阳（泰逢所好居）','Fu sunny side (Taifeng favored dwelling)','是好居于萯山之陽','It favors the sunny side of Fu mountain.','泰逢所好居方位，不另补行程山或移作和山草木。');pair(taifeng,fu)
    for god in [taifeng,xunchi,wuluo]:SHARES.append((god,'r03-summary','其祠太逢熏池武羅皆一牡羊副','The summary associates Taifeng, Xunchi and Wuluo with one ram and a fu rite.'))
    add('r03-summary','rite','ram-rite-range3','三神牡羊副礼（中次三）','Three-god ram rite (third range)','其祠太逢熏池武羅皆一牡羊副嬰用吉玉','Taifeng, Xunchi and Wuluo are associated with one ram and auspicious jade.','副郭注破羊骨磔祭为古礼，不以羊形补神躯，不画暴力祭杀。',commentary='副謂破羊骨磔之以祭也',en_commentary='Guo Pu explains fu as an ancient ram-bone rite.')
    add('r03-summary','rite','other-gods-range3','二神雄鸡礼（中次三）','Other two gods rooster rite','其二神用一雄鷄瘞之糈用稌','The other two gods use a buried rooster and rice grain.','仅录未名二神祭礼，不编两尊神形或强定每神鸡数。')
    product('r03-summary','material','rice-range3','稌（中次三祭米）','Tu rice (third-range grain offering)','糈用稌','The offering grain is tu rice.','祭米物产与神形分开，保留稌字，不定现代品种。')
    product('r04-luti','material','jade-luti','玉（鹿蹄上）','Jade (Luti above)','其上多玉','Jade is abundant above.')
    product('r04-luti','material','gold-luti','金（鹿蹄下）','Gold (Luti below)','其下多金','Gold is abundant below.')
    gan=water('r04-luti','gan-luti','甘水（鹿蹄）','Gan water (Luti)','甘水出焉而北流注于洛','Gan water rises here and flows north into the Luo.');pair(gan,luo)
    SHARES.append((luo,'r04-luti','甘水出焉而北流注于洛','Gan water flows north into the Luo.'))
    product('r04-luti','material','ling-stone-luti','泠石（甘水）','Ling stone (Gan water)','其中多泠石','Ling stone is abundant.','郭注未闻、或作涂，仅录物产异说，不定现代矿物。',commentary='未聞也泠或作涂',en_commentary='Guo Pu says it is unknown and records tu as a variant.')
    return out
